{"1727270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Murderous Muses", "steam_appid": 1727270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2350200], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE YOU UP TO THE CHALLENGE?</strong></h2>Murderous Muses is an old-school FMV adventure that rewards patience, exploration and puzzle solving. It’s not an interactive movie game but it does have over 3 hours of FMV!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO KILLED MORDECHAI GREY?</strong></h2>Play as the gallery’s night watch and explore its secrets over three days, watching paintings spring to life fuelled by ‘Eyes of Mordechai’ - a scarce resource that makes you ask questions wisely.<br><br>A year has passed since the unsolved murder of Mordechai Grey and in tribute, Gallery Argenta is about to exhibit six of the artist’s most famous portraits and prime suspects - the ‘Murderous Muses’. Question suspects, unlock police interviews, and finally deduce who’s the murderous muse!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve a murder mystery that re-rolls every time you play<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/70155722666a29ed702297234e4f8988.poster.avif?t=1762428222\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/70155722666a29ed702297234e4f8988.webm?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/70155722666a29ed702297234e4f8988.mp4?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Explore a procedurally-generated gallery and share seeds with friends<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/2160598aeb1afd45f80e34ce36a2c3